<title>NETHERLANDS: ING NO COMMENT ON OPPENHEIMER BUY REPORT.</title>
<headline>ING NO COMMENT ON OPPENHEIMER BUY REPORT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Groep NV (ING) said on Thursday it had no comment on a report it was interested in privately-owned U.S. investment firm Oppenheimer &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Weekly newspaper London Financial News reported that ING was &quot;eyeing up&quot; the New York firm.</p>
<p>ING spokesman Wieger Sietsma said it was no secret that ING had held talks with Oppenheimer and Co several years ago.</p>
<p>But he declined to comment on the London report.</p>
<p>&quot;It's like we always say, we don't comment on market rumours,&quot; he told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
